        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಪರಾಮರ್ಶಿಸು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಾಮರ್ಶಿಸು — parāmarśisu — \"to refer to; to consult\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಉತ್ತರ ಬರೆಯುವ ಮೊದಲು ನಾನು ನಿಘಂಟನ್ನು ಪರಾಮರ್ಶಿಸಿದೆ. uttara bareyuva modalu nānu nighaṇṭannu parāmarśiside. Before writing the answer I consulted the dictionary."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಪರಾಮರ್ಶಿಸಿದೆ, parāmarśiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of books and records. ಪರಾಮರ್ಶನ ಗ್ರಂಥ, a reference book."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಾಮರ್ಶಿಸು (parāmarśisu) is built on Sanskrit parāmarśa, \"seizing; consideration\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
